# Architecture

This document describes the current implemented structure, ownership, dependency direction, runtime processes, storage, and external boundaries. Update it when architecture changes; put long-lived alternatives and rationale in `docs/design-docs/` or `docs/decisions/`.

## Reading rules

- Confirmed statements are approved facts or verified current behavior.
- Proposed statements are scanner observations or candidate interpretations that require review.
- Open statements are missing decisions or facts; do not silently assume them.
- Sources identify the repository evidence or human input behind a statement.

